<title>HONG KONG: HK Jan air cargo statistics for non-Asian destinations.</title>
<headline>HK Jan air cargo statistics for non-Asian destinations.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics published for January by Hong Kong's Civil Aviation Department show that Frankfurt remained the most important European and Anchorage the most important American route for air cargo exports and imports.</p>
